OL,3,GNEWSAPair jailed after child locked in
OL,4,Aroom and starved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young boy who was "days from passing
OL,7,Faway" was locked in a room and
OL,8,F"systematically starved" before social
OL,9,Fservices discovered him and called the
OL,10,Fpolice.
OL,12,FThe primary school-aged boy was taken
OL,13,Fto hospital "critically underweight"
OL,14,Fand malnourished.
