OL,3,GNEWSAPair jailed after child locked in
OL,4,Aroom and starved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and woman from Colchester were
OL,7,Fconvicted of causing grievous bodily
OL,8,Fharm (GBH) with intent and jailed for
OL,9,F12 and 11 years respectively at Ipswich
OL,10,FCrown Court on Friday. The pair ` who
OL,11,Fare not named to protect the identity
OL,12,Fof the boy ` are white British
OL,13,Fnationals.
OL,15,FEssex Police said the boy was
OL,16,Feffectively "skin and bones" when he
OL,17,Fwas found, and the "landmark"
OL,18,Fconviction under GBH with intent
OL,19,Fcarries greater sentencing powers than
OL,20,Fchild neglect.
